"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"l0yhy32144","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"2te0v16393","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Baby yoga and massage classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"erbqj32146","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"9fwwt16395","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"eazez32148","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"x2whi16397","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'Nottingham''s parenting community is young, creative, and well-connected. West Bridgford''s parent network is vibrant and recommendation-driven.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Nottingham', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise in Nottingham. Capture baby handprints and footprints across one of the UK''s youngest cities with full training and support.', 52.955, -1.15, 330000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('hampshire-south', 'Portsmouth', 'Hampshire South: Portsmouth and Gosport', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Portsmouth and the Solent coast.', 'Portsmouth, Gosport, Havant, Fareham, Waterlooville, Emsworth', '500K+ Solent population, naval base family pipeline, military families value keepsakes, established suburban communities.', 'NCT Portsmouth, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"aplop10183","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Portsmouth and the surrounding Solent towns have a combined population exceeding 500,000. The naval base provides a constant pipeline of young families."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"1rp0410185","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"vo2kt10186","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Naval families often lack extended family nearby, making keepsakes even more precious. The wider family communities across Fareham and Waterlooville are warm, engaged, and community-focused."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ut77a10188","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"1lq7410189","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs active groups across Portsmouth. The military community has its own family support infrastructure. Community centres and family hubs provide a steady calendar."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"uehl010191","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"61hr110192","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Portsmouth''s unique military dimension, combined with established family communities, creates a territory with both volume and meaning."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Hampshire South region covers Portsmouth, Gosport, Havant, Fareham, Waterlooville, and Emsworth. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"nl28n34269","nodes":[{"id":"ob81734270","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"auhqq18013","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Portsmouth"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"72r9534272","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"8zu2y18015","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Military family support groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"5douc34274","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ngle018017","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"kk66y34276","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"tmdij18019","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"f15vd34278","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"iahfk18021","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'The parenting communities across Portsmouth and the Solent are warm and welcoming, with the military family network adding a unique dimension.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Portsmouth', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Portsmouth and the Solent coast. Capture baby handprints and footprints locally with full training and support.', 50.8, -1.1, 500000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('reading-basingstoke', 'Reading and Basingstoke', 'Reading and Basingstoke', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Berkshire and North Hampshire''s thriving family corridor.', 'Reading, Basingstoke, Wokingham, Bracknell, Newbury, Caversham', 'Thames Valley tech corridor premium, triple baby class partnerships, 500K+ population, exceptional warm start territory.', 'Established baby class partners, Established baby class partners, Established baby class partners, NCT groups', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"u877p9821","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Reading and Basingstoke sit at the heart of the Thames Valley tech corridor. The combined territory exceeds 500,000 residents, with premium families attracted by tech industry salaries and excellent schools."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"f4ic39823","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"gqyky9824","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Young tech professionals are starting families across the area, bringing premium spending patterns. Basingstoke''s growing population adds volume. These are engaged, discerning parents who invest in quality."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zrpw69826","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"0vasd9827","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"This territory benefits from triple Established baby class partners, Bracknell Forest, and Basingstoke. NCT groups are active across the territory. The baby class infrastructure is extensive."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"7vbvq9829","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"9ni7s9830","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Three separate baby class partnerships make this one of the warmest territories in the entire network. Premium demographics and strong baby class infrastructure mean a Memory Catcher can hit the ground running."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Reading and Basingstoke region covers Reading, Basingstoke, Wokingham, Bracknell, Newbury, and Caversham. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"8aw3l33793","nodes":[{"id":"gf55z33794","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"hg6dk17628","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Established baby class partners"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"o7wpm33796","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"utvz217630","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Reading and Basingstoke"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"t81vm33798","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"p3y6017632","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and development classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"7pneg33800","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"j9i6c17634","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres, church halls, and family hubs"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'The Thames Valley''s family communities are engaged and recommendation-driven. Triple baby class partnerships provide an exceptional warm start.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Reading and Basingstoke', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Reading and Basingstoke with triple baby class partnerships. Capture baby handprints and footprints with full training and support.', 51.36, -1.03, 500000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('coventry', 'Coventry', 'Coventry and Warwickshire', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Coventry and its surrounding Warwickshire towns.', 'Coventry city centre, Kenilworth, Warwick, Leamington Spa, Rugby, Nuneaton', '600K+ combined population, Leamington Spa and Warwick premium, diverse Coventry, City of Culture legacy.', 'NCT Coventry and Warwickshire, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"qstgd9088","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Coventry is the UK''s current City of Culture, and together with Warwickshire the territory covers over 600,000 residents. Leamington Spa, Warwick, and Kenilworth add premium family markets."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"3ba4x9090","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"kp7jg9091","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Leamington Spa and Warwick are among the most desirable places in the Midlands. Kenilworth adds further affluence. Coventry''s diverse communities provide volume. Rugby and Nuneaton extend the territory''s reach."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"vz7iu9093","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"2dmxt9094","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs active groups across the territory. Leamington Spa has a particularly vibrant baby class scene. The wider area benefits from strong community infrastructure."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"e6dog9096","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"vm6kd9097","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The combination of Coventry''s volume with Warwickshire''s premium markets creates one of the most balanced territories in the Midlands."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Coventry and Warwickshire region covers Coventry city centre, Kenilworth, Warwick, Leamington Spa, Rugby, and Nuneaton. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"o6z1t32782","nodes":[{"id":"od9ty32783","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"jreao16895","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Coventry and Warwickshire"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"tho3q32785","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"1awgc16897","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"qvga832787","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"p63xk16899","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"dy0pk32789","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ykb8g16901","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"dp97a32791","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ngpw116903","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'The parenting communities range from Leamington''s polished networks to Coventry''s diverse family groups.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Coventry and Warwickshire', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Coventry and Warwickshire. Capture baby handprints and footprints locally with full training and support.', 52.35, -1.5, 600000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('sutton-merton', 'Sutton and Merton', 'London: Sutton and Merton', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across South London''s family-friendly suburbs.', 'Sutton, Merton, Wimbledon Village, Mitcham, Morden, Cheam, Carshalton', 'Premium Wimbledon Village pocket, established Sutton and Cheam family communities, balanced territory with strong earning potential, vibrant baby class scene.', 'NCT Sutton and Merton, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ly5rr2413","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Sutton and Merton offer a blend of suburban family living and premium pockets that makes this a well-balanced territory. Wimbledon Village is one of the most affluent family areas in South London, while Cheam, Carshalton, and Sutton provide established family communities with strong local identities. Merton''s family population continues to grow, with young professionals settling into the area''s leafy streets and excellent schools."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"wvrsv2415","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"hgalo2416","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The family culture across these boroughs is warm and community-focused. Parents in Wimbledon Village and Cheam invest in premium products and experiences, while the broader communities across Mitcham, Morden, and Sutton town bring additional volume. The suburban feel encourages long-term community connections, and parents here recommend businesses they trust through well-established local networks."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"cyhqj2418","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"8qke32419","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs active groups across both boroughs, and independent baby classes operate from venues throughout the territory. Wimbledon''s baby class scene is particularly vibrant, with multiple providers running sessions weekly. Community centres, church halls, and family hubs across Sutton and Merton provide a steady calendar of baby and toddler groups."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"tr9sa2421","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"65rho2422","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"This territory bridges the premium South West London market and the family-rich suburbs of South London. The result is a territory where strong average order values in Wimbledon blend with consistent volume across the wider area, creating a balanced earning opportunity."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Sutton and Merton region covers Sutton, Merton, Wimbledon Village, Mitcham, Morden, Cheam, and Carshalton. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"kvtu026740","nodes":[{"id":"evpry26741","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zonwr12065","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Sutton and Merton"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"gzj2o26743","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"1z5nl12067","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"bk7wg26745","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"7fkp012069","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Baby yoga and development classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"fxgpo26747","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"761kl12071","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"3l9lf26749","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zj65i12073","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'The parenting communities across Sutton and Merton are well-established and recommendation-driven. From Wimbledon''s polished parent networks to Sutton''s warm suburban community, trust and word of mouth are the currency that matters most.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Sutton and Merton', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Sutton and Merton. Capture baby handprints and footprints in South London with full training, support, and a protected region.', 51.38, -0.19, 420000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('peterborough', 'Peterborough', 'Peterborough and The Fens', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Peterborough and the surrounding Fenland communities.', 'Peterborough, March, Wisbech, Whittlesey, Stamford, Bourne', 'Fastest-growing English city, Stamford ultra-premium pocket, high birth rates, 360K+ territory, continuous growth.', 'NCT Peterborough, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"jqfag13257","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Peterborough is one of England''s fastest-growing cities with a population exceeding 210,000. The wider territory adds another 150,000+ through Fenland and South Lincolnshire. Young demographics and strong birth rates characterise the area."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rgsjc13259","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"hxqqi13260","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Peterborough''s diverse communities have among the highest birth rates in the East of England. Stamford adds an ultra-premium Georgian town dimension. The city''s growth means constant new family arrivals."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"k4ny113262","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"k38wd13263","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs groups across Peterborough. Independent baby classes operate throughout. The growing population supports an expanding baby class scene."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"6nasw13265","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"a9dym13266","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Peterborough''s explosive growth and Stamford''s premium market create genuine balance. The high birth rates ensure consistent demand."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Peterborough and The Fens region covers Peterborough, March, Wisbech, Whittlesey, Stamford, and Bourne. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"6ey2w37690","nodes":[{"id":"ngct137691","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"9n65b21004","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Peterborough"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"x16o037693","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rqrxw21006","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and development classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"lyz3d37695","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"f7yqz21008","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"n2rpn37697","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"j40q221010","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"gox2b37699","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"0qin021012","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'Peterborough''s communities are diverse, growing, and family-focused.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Peterborough', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Peterborough. Capture baby handprints and footprints in one of England''s fastest-growing cities with full training and support.', 52.57, -0.15, 360000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('cornwall', 'Cornwall', 'Cornwall', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Cornwall''s unique family communities.', 'Truro, Falmouth, Newquay, St Austell, Penzance, Bodmin', '570K+ unique county, Falmouth and Truro premium, craft heritage culture, self-contained market, strong Cornish identity.', 'NCT Cornwall, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"10yex12717","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Cornwall has a population exceeding 570,000 and a unique identity as a county with its own cultural character. The county attracts families from across the UK drawn by the lifestyle, coastline, and community culture."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"iubv712719","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ij4mq12720","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Falmouth and Truro are the premium family areas, with creative, engaged parent communities. Newquay''s growing family side, beyond the surf culture, adds young demographics. The county''s craft heritage perfectly aligns with handmade keepsakes."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rqdt212722","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"2o1tk12723","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs groups across Cornwall. Independent baby classes operate from venues throughout. The geography means communities are naturally spaced, with clusters around the main towns."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"8kdkw12725","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"5eraw12726","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Cornwall''s isolation creates a self-contained market where a local Memory Catcher becomes the natural choice. The county''s craft appreciation and community bonds make it a rewarding territory."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Cornwall region covers Truro, Falmouth, Newquay, St Austell, Penzance, and Bodmin. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"bdw4r37269","nodes":[{"id":"vvywh37270","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"lzsjp20635","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Cornwall"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"dd44m37272","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"uo43g20637","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and development classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"0kec737274","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"i2opq20639","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"l3chc37276","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"bc0ib20641","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"tmp0i37278","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"fostp20643","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'Cornwall''s communities are warm, creative, and fiercely proud of their Cornish identity.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Cornwall', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Cornwall. Capture baby handprints and footprints in one of England''s most unique counties with full training and support.', 50.42, -4.85, 570000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('kent-east', 'East Kent', 'East Kent: Canterbury, Thanet and Dover', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across East Kent''s historic coastal communities.', 'Canterbury, Margate, Ramsgate, Broadstairs, Dover, Deal, Whitstable', 'Canterbury university prestige, Whitstable and Broadstairs premium coast, 450K+ territory, London family influx.', 'NCT East Kent, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"78uv411879","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"East Kent has a combined population exceeding 450,000 across Canterbury, Thanet, and Dover. Canterbury brings university prestige and a thriving family community. Whitstable and Broadstairs have become two of the south east''s most desirable coastal towns for young families."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"jmh8511881","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"sal1111882","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Whitstable and Broadstairs draw creative, independent-minded families from London seeking a better quality of life. Canterbury''s family areas are well-established and engaged. Thanet''s regeneration is bringing new energy and younger demographics."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"xkat611884","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"weclr11885","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT runs groups across East Kent. Independent baby classes operate from venues throughout. Whitstable and Canterbury are particularly well-served with vibrant baby class scenes."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rr3lu11887","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"d5l7z11888","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"East Kent offers a compelling mix of university prestige, premium coastal living, and growing communities. The London exodus is injecting fresh energy and premium spending patterns into the area."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your East Kent region covers Canterbury, Margate, Ramsgate, Broadstairs, Dover, Deal, and Whitstable. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"6o9my36174","nodes":[{"id":"ah34w36175","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"1rg1319785","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT East Kent"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"vcj1n36177","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"hv19b19787","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"bbbdu36179","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zbu9u19789","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"bhqo936181","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"adkse19791","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"5frei36183","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"6039d19793","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'East Kent''s family communities blend historic charm with creative coastal energy.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in East Kent', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across East Kent. Capture baby handprints and footprints locally with full training and support.', 51.25, 1.15, 450000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('glasgow', 'Glasgow', 'Glasgow City', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Scotland''s largest and most vibrant city.', 'Glasgow city centre, West End, Southside, Shawlands, Bearsden', 'Scotland''s largest city (650K+), 34.6% of population aged 25-44, highest volume Scottish territory, strong community identity and family culture.', 'NCT Scotland, multiple independent baby class providers, family centres across the city', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"yu66d607","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Glasgow is Scotland''s largest city with over 650,000 residents, and it has a demographic profile that''s tailor-made for a Memory Catcher. More than a third of Glasgow''s population falls into the 25-44 age group, significantly higher than the Scottish average of around 26%. The city''s working-age population stands at nearly 69%, and population density is more than 50 times the Scottish average at 3,562 people per square kilometre. That density means more parents within a shorter commute, which translates directly into more sessions per day."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"fyddu60192","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"yfsli609","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Glasgow''s family communities have a warmth and loyalty that''s hard to replicate. The West End, Southside, and Shawlands are thriving family areas where independent businesses are supported passionately. Parents here value authenticity and community over corporate polish, and they rally around local services they trust. Once you''re established in even one baby class, the recommendations flow naturally across the wider network."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"phwym60198","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"cuxnr611","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The baby class offering across Glasgow is growing. NCT Scotland runs antenatal courses and postnatal groups across the city, and a range of independent baby sensory, massage, and music classes operate from venues in the West End, Southside, and beyond. Family centres and community hubs provide additional touchpoints for connecting with new parents. The city''s compact geography means you can reach classes across multiple neighbourhoods within short travel times."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"naync60204","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ec5fe613","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Glasgow offers the highest volume potential of any Scottish territory. While Edinburgh commands premium pricing, Glasgow''s strength is in numbers, a larger population, a younger demographic, and a density that keeps travel time low and earning potential high. It''s the workhorse territory of the Scottish network."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Glasgow City region covers Glasgow city centre, the West End, Southside, Shawlands, and Bearsden. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"z9ckm24636","nodes":[{"id":"h72ui24637","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"vblur10357","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Scotland Glasgow groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"ilg5r24639","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"wch0u10359","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and music classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"biwrg24641","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"n7dcx10361","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family centres and community hubs across Glasgow"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"elz7w24643","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"8h6bf10363","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Church halls and community venues"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"1s8on24645","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"jlmh110365","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby rhyme time sessions"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'Glasgow''s communities are tight-knit and word-of-mouth driven. Parents here support businesses they believe in, and once you''ve built trust in your local area, the referrals come thick and fast. The city''s strong sense of community identity works in your favour from the start.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise in Glasgow, Scotland | Apply', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise in Glasgow. Capture baby handprints and footprints across Scotland''s largest city with full training, support, and a protected region.', 55.86, -4.25, 650000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('inverness', 'Inverness', 'Inverness and the Highlands', true, '£3,445', 'Either', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across the Scottish Highlands'' capital.', 'Inverness, Nairn, Dingwall, Fort William, Aviemore', 'Capital of the Highlands, self-contained market, zero competition, growing Inverness, adventurous franchise territory.', 'NCT Scotland, independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zd2bf13739","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Inverness is the capital of the Highlands with a growing population exceeding 75,000. The wider territory adds further depth through Nairn, Dingwall, and the Aviemore corridor."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zxfam13741","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"dja9e13742","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Inverness families are community-minded and loyal. The city''s relative isolation means families particularly value local services. The growing population includes families relocated from urban centres seeking a different lifestyle."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"sbpq913744","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"dag4o13745","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Scotland runs occasional groups. Independent providers and community groups operate from venues across the territory."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"7eqc713747","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"az05k13748","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The Highlands require an adventurous mindset. In return, you get a self-contained market with zero competition and families who value genuine connection above all else."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Inverness and Highlands region covers Inverness, Nairn, Dingwall, Fort William, and Aviemore. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"oplve38251","nodes":[{"id":"xcyuj38252","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"nmhq921595","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Scotland Highlands"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"vmoyv38254","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"jdtlu21597","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"bsxs938256","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"cj6c221599","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"ztgdh38258","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"tjktz21601","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"u0rvm38260","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"d14oa21603","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Library baby groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'Highland communities are welcoming and fiercely loyal.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Inverness and the Highlands', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise in the Scottish Highlands. Capture baby handprints and footprints across Inverness and beyond with full training and support.', 57.3, -4.6, 240000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('derry-northwest', 'Derry/Londonderry', 'Derry and North West NI', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across Northern Ireland''s north west.', 'Derry/Londonderry, Strabane, Limavady, Coleraine, Magherafelt', 'NI''s second city, young demographics, strong birth rates, legendary community warmth, NI North West anchor.', 'NCT Northern Ireland, independent baby class providers, family centres', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"m7ujt13854","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Derry/Londonderry is Northern Ireland''s second city with a young population exceeding 150,000. The wider North West territory adds substantial depth. Young demographics and strong birth rates characterise the area."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"pcg6a13856","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ioec013857","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The family communities across the North West are warm and incredibly well-connected. Northern Irish warmth is legendary, and it''s especially strong in the North West."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rujpv13859","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"htmqx13860","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby classes and community groups operate from venues across the territory. Community centres and church halls provide regular sessions."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"65b0113862","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"s7kbk13863","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"This territory offers genuine scale across Northern Ireland''s second city and surrounding towns. Note: different legal frameworks may apply for franchise agreements in Northern Ireland."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Derry and North West NI region covers Derry/Londonderry, Strabane, Limavady, Coleraine, and Magherafelt. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"id05c38388","nodes":[{"id":"7ehug38389","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"m619121717","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Northern Ireland"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"mrvrg38391","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ch07021719","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"jytg138393","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"qh4hg21721","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"oh2wu38395","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"ns50n21723","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Family hubs and children''s centres"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"9zzjk38397","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"fi5g121725","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Church groups"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'North West NI communities are legendary for warmth and connection.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Derry/Londonderry', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise across Derry and Northern Ireland''s North West. Capture baby handprints and footprints locally with full training and support.', 54.95, -7.3, 230000)
insert into public.franchise_regions (slug, city_name, region, is_available, buy_in, franchise_potential, hero_subtitle, coverage_areas, card_profile_summary, baby_classes_in_area, why_area, region_coverage_desc, baby_classes_list, community_note, franchisee_bio, meta_title, meta_description, latitude, longitude, population) values ('nappy-valley', 'Nappy Valley', 'London: Nappy Valley - Wandsworth, Battersea, Clapham', true, '£3,445', 'Full-Time', 'A flexible, family-friendly franchise capturing baby handprints and footprints across London''s most famous family neighbourhood, where premium meets parenthood.', 'Wandsworth, Battersea, Clapham, Balham, Tooting, Earlsfield', 'London''s most famous family neighbourhood, highest average order value potential in the UK, exceptional baby class density, affluent and engaged young parents.', 'Busylizzy Club Earlsfield, NCT Battersea/Wandsworth/Wimbledon, Bump and Baby Club, multiple premium antenatal providers', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"oozs31917","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"If there''s one place in the UK synonymous with new parents, it''s Nappy Valley. The stretch of South West London running through Wandsworth, Battersea, and Clapham has earned its nickname for a reason, this is where some of the UK''s highest-earning young professionals settle down to start families. The concentration of engaged, affluent parents here is unlike anywhere else in the country, and average order values for premium keepsakes reflect that."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"xniiw1919","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"zkfu51920","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Walk through Northcote Road on any weekday morning and you''ll see it immediately. Buggies everywhere, coffee shops packed with new mums, baby classes running back to back in every church hall and community space. The parenting culture here isn''t just active, it''s the social infrastructure. Parents in Nappy Valley invest heavily in experiences and keepsakes that mark their children''s milestones, and they talk to each other. Word of mouth in this community travels fast."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"rabte1922","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"8smfs1923","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"The baby class scene across Wandsworth and Clapham is exceptional. Busylizzy Club runs out of Earlsfield with a packed weekly programme. NCT is extremely active across Battersea, Wandsworth, and Wimbledon with well-attended antenatal courses and postnatal meetups. Bump and Baby Club, multiple private antenatal providers, and a host of independent baby sensory and yoga classes fill the weekly calendar. As a Memory Catcher, you''d have more warm rooms to walk into than days of the week."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"b2k6w1925","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.3","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"esc4b1926","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"This is the highest average order value territory in the UK. Parents here don''t hesitate to invest in beautifully crafted, meaningful keepsakes, and the density of baby classes within a tight geographical area means you can attend multiple sessions per day without long commutes. Premium demographics, premium density, premium opportunity."},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}]}', 'Your Nappy Valley region covers Wandsworth, Battersea, Clapham, Balham, Tooting, and Earlsfield. This is your exclusive area, and no other Memory Catcher will operate here.', '{"documentStyle":{},"nodes":[{"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0},"id":"o5gj623894","nodes":[{"id":"jgvau23895","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"d1q859756","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Busylizzy Club Earlsfield"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"dfs5323897","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"6baz99758","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"NCT Battersea, Wandsworth, and Wimbledon"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"0cx1p23899","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"bpwew9760","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Bump and Baby Club"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"1h3d223901","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"97l219762","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Multiple premium private antenatal providers"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"l8yi123903","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"t2fey9764","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Independent baby sensory and yoga classes"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"},{"id":"dq6eu23905","nodes":[{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"lineHeight":"1.8","textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{"paddingBottom":"0px","paddingTop":"0px"},"id":"aho1e9766","nodes":[{"id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"decorations":[],"text":"Community centres and church halls across SW London"},"type":"TEXT"}],"type":"PARAGRAPH"}],"type":"LIST_ITEM"}],"type":"BULLETED_LIST"}]}', 'The parenting community in Nappy Valley is tight-knit and recommendation-driven. Once you''re known and trusted in even one baby class, the referrals follow naturally. This is a community that talks, and when they find something good, they share it.', null, 'Baby Keepsake Franchise Opportunity in Nappy Valley', 'Start a flexible Memory Catcher franchise in London''s Nappy Valley. Capture baby handprints and footprints across Wandsworth, Battersea, and Clapham with full training and a protected region.', 51.46, -0.16, 330000)
